  "claim": "The documentaries One Big Hapa Family and A Film Unfinished were directed by the same person.",
  "evidencia": "Page: One Big Hapa Family. Sentence: One Big Hapa Family is a 2010 animated/live-action documentary film directed by Canadian director Jeff Chiba Stearns.\nPage: A Film Unfinished. Sentence: A Film Unfinished (Hebrew title: \"שתיקת הארכיון\" \"Shtikat haArkhion\", German title: \"Geheimsache Ghettofilm\") is a 2010 documentary film by Yael Hersonski, which re-examines the making of an unfinished 1942 German propaganda film (titled \"Das Ghetto\", \"The Ghetto\") depicting the Warsaw Ghetto two months before the mass extermination of its inhabitants in the German operation known as the Grossaktion Warsaw.",
  "evidence_text": "Page: One Big Hapa Family. Sentence: One Big Hapa Family is a 2010 animated/live-action documentary film directed by Canadian director Jeff Chiba Stearns.\nPage: A Film Unfinished. Sentence: A Film Unfinished (Hebrew title: \"שתיקת הארכיון\" \"Shtikat haArkhion\", German title: \"Geheimsache Ghettofilm\") is a 2010 documentary film by Yael Hersonski, which re-examines the making of an unfinished 1942 German propaganda film (titled \"Das Ghetto\", \"The Ghetto\") depicting the Warsaw Ghetto two months before the mass extermination of its inhabitants in the German operation known as the Grossaktion Warsaw.",
